{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12697","headline":"夜宴石鱼湖作 · 元结","name":"夜宴石鱼湖作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风霜虽惨然，出游熙天正。\n登临日暮归，置酒湖上亭。\n高烛照泉深，光华溢轩楹。\n如见海底日，曈曈始欲生。\n夜寒闭窗户，石溜何清泠。\n若在深洞中，半崖闻水声。\n醉人疑舫影，呼指递相惊。\n何故有双鱼，随吾酒舫行。\n醉昏能诞语，劝醉能忘情。\n坐无拘忌人，勿限醉与醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}